certainty"], "rationale": "With an even partisan baseline, no incumbent, no polls, no ratings, and no market pricing, there is no evidence justifying movement in either direction. The race stays at a pure tossup with wide uncertainty.", "watch": "General-election polling, the outcome of the Democratic primary fight between moderate and progressive wings, and any expert ratings or market pricing could quickly move this forecast.", "confidence": "low", "notes": ["No expert ratings published yet; forecast rests on fundamentals and polls.", "New or vacant seat with no expert ratings; fundamentals only.", "No usable general-election polls; forecast rests on fundamentals and expert ratings."]}, "overview": "Wisconsin's presidential race sits on knife's edge heading into the 2028 cycle. The state's partisan lean is dead even, and with a term-limited incumbent, neither party starts with an incumbency edge. No general-election polls, expert ratings, or prediction-market pricing are available yet, so the race is rated a pure tossup with unusually wide uncertainty.\n\nThe main storylines so far involve the Democratic side, where moderates and progressives appear headed for a contested primary that could shape the fall coalition, and broader concerns about polling reliability and election administration in battleground states. Neither factor yet favors a party clearly; the race remains genuinely up for grabs.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.498, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.4982, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.5145, "margin": 0.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.4971, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.5003, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.498, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.5067, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.5039, "margin": 0.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.5006, "margin": 0.0}]}